                                "sense_id": "fbcd5364-7aa6-37ea-891b-9916665a993e",
                                "text": "The history of the water sport, which began to gain international fame in the 1970s, dates back to 278 BC, when Qu Yuan, a Chinese poet and official, committed suicide on the Miluo River in Hunan Province in protest of the court’s alliances and betrayals during the Zhou dynasty."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
